                  "outbox_queue_depth")}
+    # SAME DEFECT, SECOND PARTITION. Placement and policy assignment are
+    # ADMINISTRATOR DECISIONS, not enrolment facts, and `EndpointRecord`
+    # defaults them to None — so `$set`ting the whole record cleared the
+    # group, the policy and their provenance on every re-enrolment. The
